---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getUrl } from '../../utils/nav';
---

<BaseLayout title="Legacy Supply Chain Product Modernization" description="Project detail">
  <main class="page-shell project-detail-shell">
    <article class="project-detail">
      <div class="project-header">
        <a href={getUrl('/projects')} class="back-link"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> All case studies</a>
        <h1>Legacy Supply Chain Product Modernization</h1>
        <p class="project-intro">Examined how legacy operational workflows were constraining product innovation and user effectiveness across a supply chain platform.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="project-meta-grid">
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Client:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Supply chain operations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Role:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Researcher & product strategist</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Focus:</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Workflow analysis, process decomposition, modernization strategy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-item">
          <span class="meta-label">Preview:</span>
          <a href="#" class="meta-link">View project →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-content">
        <section class="content-section">
          <h2>Understanding how legacy processes constrain modern product evolution</h2>
          <p>The platform's user experience was heavily constrained by legacy operational workflows that had been embedded over decades. We needed to understand which workflows were truly necessary and which were creating unnecessary friction in the product.</p>
          <p>Through deep workflow analysis and stakeholder interviews, we identified the root causes of friction and created a more targeted roadmap for modernization. This helped the product team prioritize efforts and communicate the value of evolution to leadership.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
